  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.0.6 (SpawnDev fork): Single additive change on top of 10.0.5 - `MediaStreamTrack.StreamStatus` setter widened from `internal` to `public`. Lets consumers like `SpawnDev.MultiMedia` set the W3C `MediaStreamTrack.enabled`-equivalent state from outside the `SIPSorcery.*` namespace without reflection or wrapper indirection. Zero behavior change otherwise; the field's existing internal callers still set it the same way. Source: commit `c4b5f79e8` on the LostBeard/sipsorcery fork. Ships with the SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.8 stable cut so consumers picking up the RTC rollup get the widening transitively. v10.0.5 changelog (Production-TURN extensions: TurnServerConfig.ResolveHmacKey + RelayPortRangeStart/End, SctpAssociation.MaxBurst + BurstPeriodMilliseconds, SctpDataSender producer-consumer lost-wakeup race fix) is still in 10.0.6 - this is purely additive.",
